+The first P4.8 probe is reviewed failed, with 18/21 cases passing. All fourteen axe scans have zero blocking violations, but retained incomplete results require additional evidence. Fifteen captures and all329 source hashes/fourteen preserved hashes were reviewed before edits; immutable first evidence is published in docs/perf/phase-four/p4-8-first-review.json. The full85 cases and all three profiles did not run. Three browser test assumptions are corrected without changing engine membership: page-target keyboard events retain actual popover focus instead of dismissing it; disabling planets preserves every other current member including Ceres; a close True-scale view of the disabled Earth creates genuine empty geometry. Query/cleanup, native keys, camera motion, selection and timing assertions remain required.
